<title>TURKEY: Court gives go-ahead for Turk Telekom sale.</title>
<headline>Court gives go-ahead for Turk Telekom sale.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's constitutional court on Thursday approved most of a law allowing for the sale of Turk Telekom, the centrepiece of the government's privatisation plans, a court official said.</p>
<p>&quot;This decision will not block the sale of Telekom shares,&quot; the official told reporters. The court rejected only an article governing the sale of mobile phones licences.</p>
</text>
